      "content": "\"strengthen the ethical commitment\" sounds nice, but we both know that's not how Washington works. ethics don't stop people from chasing headlines or trying to tank an administration.\n\nif we're being realistic—not \"textbook\" realistic, but actual real-world realistic—isn't a legal expansion of executive privilege a more practical and effective way to ensure the government actually works? isn't it better to have a clear legal shield for the president rather than just hoping politicians act \"ethically\" when they're actually just being partisan?",
